# Database Conventions

- Inspect existing schema/migrations before adding tables or columns
- Prefer additive, reversible migrations
- Enforce ownership/tenant filters in queries (prevent IDOR)
- Index what you filter/join on in hot paths
- Never put secrets in the database casually; encrypt or use a vault pattern if required
- Document breaking schema changes in the PR/report

See `docs/conventions/database.md`
